    <tags>guchho bundler build javascript typescript</tags>
    <summary>Fast build system for web applications.</summary>
    <description>Guchho is a fast JavaScript/TypeScript bundler. It bundles, minifies, and transforms web applications with high performance.

## Features

- HTML-first application bundling 
- JavaScript and TypeScript support 
- CSS bundling and minification 
- Asset processing 
- Tree shaking 
- Code splitting 
- Source maps 
- JSX/TSX support 
- Watch mode 
- Production builds

## Usage

```
guchho init 
guchho dev --open
```

For more information, visit: https://github.com/guchho/guchho</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/guchho/guchho/releases</releaseNotes>
